Reservation


User requests reservation
        ↓
Atomically claim spot in DB
        ↓
status = RESERVED
reservationId = X
expiresAt = T+30 min
        ↓
Redis SET reservation:X spotId EX 1800

If user completes booking:

RESERVED → OCCUPIED

If user doesn't complete within 30 minutes:
RESERVED → AVAILABLE


________________________


"For a reservation, I'll atomically mark the spot as RESERVED in the DB with a reservation ID and expiry time. I can maintain a Redis key with a TTL for fast expiration tracking. If the user completes the reservation, we transition RESERVED to OCCUPIED. 
If the reservation expires, we atomically transition it back to AVAILABLE, verifying the reservation ID so an old expiry event cannot release a newer reservation."
